<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Our souls are held by all they hold;</l><l>Slaves still are slaves in chains of gold;</l><l>To whatsoever we may cling,</l><l>We make it a soul-chaining thing.</l><l>Whether it be a life or land,</l><l>And dear as our right eye or hand.</l><l>Whether it be a life or land,</l><l>And dear as our right eye or hand.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Wherever you ripe fields behold,</l><l>Waving to God their sheaves of gold,</l><l>Be sure some com of wheat has died,</l><l>Some saintly soul been crucified;</l><l>Someone has suffered, wept and prayed,</l><l>And fought hell’s legions undismayed.</l><l>Someone has suffered, wept and prayed,</l><l>And fought hell’s legions undismayed.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
